Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for traceDependencies. Trace design, procurement, trade interfaces, and schedule dependencies using exact project graphs. Judge which dependencies are materially affected, distinguish potential from confirmed delay, and identify evidence needed to support commercial or timing claims. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
